// Cisco Show Commands Input | T1552.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/network/cisco/aaa/cisco_cli_input_capture.yml
*show\ history* OR *show\ history\ all* OR *show\ logging*

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
    "bool": {
      "must": [
        {
          "query_string": {
            "query": "*show\\ history* OR *show\\ history\\ all* OR *show\\ logging*",
            "analyze_wildcard": true
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
